  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-messager",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) | [English](README.en.md)\n\nDeepSeek Harness（DSH）的任务通知插件。会话需要审批、提问或计划审核，任务完成或出错时，可发送系统通知、浏览器通知，以及飞书、企业微信、Discord、钉钉、Telegram 消息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "兼容版本",
      "text": "**v0.3.6 支持 DSH `0.2.0-rc.1` 及兼容的后续 0.2.x 版本。** 使用 DSH 0.1.x 请保留对应的旧版插件。升级到 DSH 0.2.x 后再安装本版本；现有通知配置无需迁移。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "**DSH 桌面版：**点击左上角「插件」→「添加插件」，输入 `dsh-messager` 并安装。安装后重启 DSH。\n\n**命令行版（npm 包）：**需要 Node.js 20+、pnpm 和 DSH CLI。将包安装到 Web profile：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-messager\ndsh web\n```\n\n如果从 DSH 源码仓库运行，将 `dsh` 换为 `pnpm dsh`。安装后若 DSH 已在运行，请重启。\n\n**从源码安装**（开发者可选）：\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/ly6170/dsh-messager.git\ncd dsh-messager\npnpm install\npnpm build"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "打开 DSH 设置页的「通知&信使」分区，选择触发时机、启用通道并填写对应的 webhook 或 Bot 信息，然后保存。浏览器通知默认开启；系统通知在桌面版默认关闭、其他环境默认开启；第三方通道默认关闭。浏览器或应用通知还需要相应权限。\n\n通知只针对需要交互、根会话任务完成和任务出错；运行中的蓝色状态不会触发通知。桌面版窗口失焦时也会提醒当前会话完成。推送消息不再附带跳转链接。配置修改保存后即可生效。"
    },
    {
      "section": "常见问题",
      "text": "- **设置分区未出现或配置路由返回 404**：检查插件是否安装到当前使用的 `web` profile、DSH 是否已重启，以及 DSH 与插件版本是否兼容。\n- **浏览器通知未出现**：检查站点通知权限；默认仅在页面隐藏或失焦时发送。\n- **桌面版通知未出现**：检查应用通知权限；如桌面应用的通知被系统丢弃，可在设置页启用「系统通知」通道作为备用。\n- **用 `--patch` 调试时设置不可用**：该模式只加载 host 端。要使用设置页，请通过 `dsh plugin add` 安装。\n\n[English](README.en.md) · [MIT License](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-messager",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) | [English](README.en.md)\n\nA task notification plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Get system, browser, Feishu, WeCom, Discord, DingTalk, or Telegram notifications when a session needs approval or input, a task completes, or a task fails."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "**v0.3.6 supports DSH `0.2.0-rc.1` and compatible later 0.2.x releases.** Keep the matching older plugin version for DSH 0.1.x. Upgrade DSH before installing this version; existing notification settings need no migration."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "**DSH desktop app:** Open **Plugins** in the top-left corner, choose **Add plugin**, enter `dsh-messager`, and install it. Restart DSH after installation.\n\n**CLI (npm package):** Requires Node.js 20+, pnpm, and the DSH CLI. Install into the Web profile:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-messager\ndsh web\n```\n\nWhen running DSH from its source repository, use `pnpm dsh` instead of `dsh`. Restart DSH if it was already running.\n\n**From source** (optional for developers):"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/ly6170/dsh-messager.git\ncd dsh-messager\npnpm install\npnpm build"
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "Open **Settings → Messenger** (「通知&信使」), choose the events and channels you want, enter any webhook or bot credentials, and save. Browser notifications are enabled by default. System notifications default to off in the desktop app and on elsewhere; third-party channels default to off. Browser or app notifications require the corresponding permission."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "Notifications cover interactions, root-session task completion, and task errors. Running status does not trigger a notification. In the desktop app, losing window focus can also trigger completion notices for the open session. Push messages no longer include links. Saved settings take effect immediately."
    },
    {
      "section": "Troubleshooting",
      "text": "- **Settings section missing or config route returns 404:** Check the active `web` profile, restart DSH, and verify DSH/plugin version compatibility.\n- **No browser notification:** Check site permission. By default, notifications appear only when the page is hidden or unfocused.\n- **No desktop notification:** Check app notification permission. If the system drops the app's notifications, enable the **System notifications** channel in settings as a fallback.\n- **Settings unavailable with `--patch`:** That development mode loads only the host side. Install with `dsh plugin add` to use the settings page."
    },
    {
      "section": "Troubleshooting",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) · [MIT License](LICENSE)"
    }
  ],
